    "raw": "You call upon the powers of unlife to render the subject blinded or deafened, as you choose.Mythic Blindness/DeafnessSource Mythic Adventures pg. 86\nYou can cause the target to be both blinded and deafened at the same time. The target must attempt a saving throw against each effect separately.",
